      "dc:source": "australian-capital-territory-and-jervis-bay-lands-acquisition.pdf, p.1",
      "values:originalText": "(1.} Section ten of the Seat oj Government Acceptance Ad\n1909-1938 is repealed.\n(2.) Notwithstanding the IU<1t preceding sub-section, the provisions\n'of the Lands Acquisaion. Ad 190G-19:.1G. as applied by section ten of\nthe 8Mf of Gocemmen: Acceptance Act 1909-1\\)38, continue to apply\nin relation to the Acquisition of land. acquired, or agreed to IJe Acquired,\nbefore the commencement of this Act, in pursuance of the firstmentioned Act as so applied.\n(3.) The Seat oj Gooemment Acceptance Act 1909-1938, as amended\nby this section, may be cited as tLe Seat oj Government Acceptance\nAct 1909-1955.",
      "skos:definition": "(1.} Section ten of the Seat oj Government Acceptance Ad\n1909-1938 is repealed.\n(2.) Notwithstanding the IU<1t preceding sub-section, the provisions\n'of the Lands Acquisaion. Ad 190G-19:.1G. as applied by section ten of\nthe 8Mf of Gocemmen: Acceptance Act 1909-1\\)38, continue to apply\nin relation to the Acquisition of land. acquired, or agreed to IJe Acquired,\nbefore the commencement of this Act, in pursuance of the firstmentioned Act as so applied.\n(3.) The Seat oj Gooemment Acceptance Act 1909-1938, as amended\nby this section, may be cited as tLe Seat oj Government Acceptance\nAct 1909-1955.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-capital-territory-and-jervis-bay-lands-acquisition-sec-4-norm"
