      "dc:source": "australian-capital-territory-and-jervis-bay-lands-acquisition.pdf, p.2",
      "values:originalText": "(1.) Sectio n si x o f th e Jervis Bay Territory Acceptance Act\n1915 i s repealed .\n(2.) Notwithstandin g th e last preceding sub-section, the provisions\nof th e Lands Acquisition Act 1906-1936 , as applie d b y sectio n si x of\nthe Jervis Bay Territory Acceptance Act 1915 , continue t o appl y i n\nrelation t o the acquisitio n o f land acquired , o r agreed t o be acquired,\nbefore th e commencemen t o f thi s Act , i n pursuanc e o f th e first -\nmentioned Ac t a s s o applied .\n(3.) Th e Jervis Bay Territory Acceptance Act 1915, as amended by\nthis section , ma y b e cite d a s th e Jervis Bay Territory Acceptance\nAct 1915-1955.\nDealings with\nGrown lands .\nAmendment of\nSeat of\nGovernment\n{Administration)\nAct 1930-1935 .\nAmendment of\nJrrvU Bay\nT-rrilory\nAicep'ance\nAd 1915 .",
